WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.467 --> 00:00:08.502
Long ago, a wealthy landowner lived in Louisiana.

2
00:00:08.503 --> 00:00:11.917
His name was Charles Durance.

3
00:00:11.918 --> 00:00:14.727
He had two daughters who were getting married.

4
00:00:14.728 --> 00:00:19.004
Their weddings were planned for the same day at their father's farm.

5
00:00:19.005 --> 00:00:22.693
Mr. Durance loved his daughters very much.

6
00:00:22.694 --> 00:00:28.224
So, he decided to prepare a big surprise for them.

7
00:00:28.225 --> 00:00:30.591
"My daughters' weddings are coming up.

8
00:00:30.592 --> 00:00:34.426
Is there a way to make it a special day for them?" he wondered.

9
00:00:34.427 --> 00:00:41.978
After days of thinking, he came up with a wonderful idea.

10
00:00:41.979 --> 00:00:44.514
He went to talk to his servants.

11
00:00:44.515 --> 00:00:46.335
"I need lots of spiders.

12
00:00:46.336 --> 00:00:49.052
Where can I get some?" he asked.

13
00:00:49.053 --> 00:00:53.538
"You can probably get them from China," one of his servants replied.

14
00:00:53.539 --> 00:00:55.821
"How many spiders do you need?"

15
00:00:55.822 --> 00:01:00.175
"I need millions of them," said Mr. Durance.

16
00:01:00.176 --> 00:01:02.486
The servants were surprised.

17
00:01:02.487 --> 00:01:04.474
"Spiders are expensive.

18
00:01:04.475 --> 00:01:08.997
They will have to come on a ship from China," one servant explained.

19
00:01:08.998 --> 00:01:11.528
Charles ordered the spiders anyway.

20
00:01:11.529 --> 00:01:17.441
Several months later, a shipload of spiders arrived from China.

21
00:01:17.442 --> 00:01:22.431
"What shall we do with all the spiders?" the servants asked Mr. Durance.

22
00:01:22.432 --> 00:01:28.921
"Let them loose in the trees along the road to the house," he instructed.

23
00:01:28.922 --> 00:01:32.777
"Why are we letting all of these spiders loose?" they wondered.

24
00:01:32.778 --> 00:01:35.616
"It's almost time for his daughters' weddings."

25
00:01:35.617 --> 00:01:40.858
Mr. Durance's servants were puzzled.

26
00:01:40.859 --> 00:01:45.644
Over the next few days, the spiders spun webs throughout the trees.

27
00:01:45.645 --> 00:01:48.196
Mr. Durance called his servants.

28
00:01:48.197 --> 00:01:50.114
"I want you to go into town.

29
00:01:50.115 --> 00:01:58.359
Order two hundred kilograms each of gold and silver powder from California," he directed.

30
00:01:58.360 --> 00:02:06.462
"Did he just tell us to order two hundred kilograms each of gold and silver powder?" they asked each other.

31
00:02:06.463 --> 00:02:08.024
"That's what he said.

32
00:02:08.025 --> 00:02:10.992
He certainly has the money to buy the powder.

33
00:02:10.993 --> 00:02:13.038
But why does he need it?"

34
00:02:13.039 --> 00:02:16.039
The servants were puzzled and curious.

35
00:02:16.040 --> 00:02:19.987
A few days later, the gold and silver powder arrived.

36
00:02:19.988 --> 00:02:22.825
Charles Durance was very satisfied.

37
00:02:22.826 --> 00:02:25.881
It was the day of his two daughters' weddings.

38
00:02:25.882 --> 00:02:30.450
"Sprinkle the powder on the spider webs!" he ordered.

39
00:02:30.451 --> 00:02:34.187
Mr. Durance's instructions surprised the servants again.

40
00:02:34.188 --> 00:02:38.506
But they did as he said and sprinkled the powder on the webs.

41
00:02:38.507 --> 00:02:43.891
When they were finished, they saw what Charles Durance had planned.

42
00:02:43.892 --> 00:02:47.651
The spider webs along the road sparkled in the sunlight.

43
00:02:47.652 --> 00:02:50.832
"Look at this!" the guests marveled.

44
00:02:50.833 --> 00:02:55.353
"Oh my, this is beautiful!" they exclaimed.

45
00:02:55.354 --> 00:03:00.823
The beautiful, sparkling spider webs amazed everyone who came to the weddings.

46
00:03:00.824 --> 00:03:03.769
"Haven't I planned a beautiful wedding day for you?"

47
00:03:03.770 --> 00:03:08.216
Mr. Durance remarked to his daughters.

48
00:03:08.217 --> 00:03:10.709
"Father, thank you so much!

49
00:03:10.710 --> 00:03:14.871
It is so beautiful!" they replied with delight.

50
00:03:14.872 --> 00:03:24.909
"Well," their father explained, "I wanted you both to have the most expensive weddings in the world!"
